  2 
  
  5>2
  
  pop -> 5
  push ->2 
  
  4
  
  push 4
  
  1
  pop 4,2
  push 1
  
  
  Monotonic stack/queue:
  Monotonic stack/queue are advanced data structure that always
  maintains elements in either increasing or decreasing order.
  
 
